# PLACEHOLDER (PMAT-5737, FLOW-009 RC-2). This is not a key: `ssh-keygen -Y verify` cannot pass against it,
# so scripts/ci_receipt_verify.sh answers RECEIPT_OK=0 for every PR and the full gate runs (fail closed).
# The operator-run forjar apply generates the lambda batcher's ed25519 key and replaces this file with ONE
# line: `ssh-ed25519 <base64> [comment]`. Replacing it is a separate one-way PR (quorum): it decides who may
# waive the gate. The verifier reads only the first two fields of that line.
